200 IF C(1,1) = 10 AND C(1,2) = 20 AND C(2,1) = 30 AND C(2,2) = 40 AND A(1,1) = 10 AND A(1,2) = 20 AND A(2,1) = 30 AND A(2,2) = 40 &
